contentText:
Back in January 2020, when Drake tied the Glee cast&#8217;s record for notching the most Billboard Hot 100 entries ever, he posted a selfie video in which he says directly to camera: &#8220;One more to go. Gleeful!&#8221;

Now, with Wednesday&#8217;s (Oct. 21) news of a Glee reboot coming to Disney+ and Hulu , one Gleek is ready for the New Directions to reclaim their record.

